I'll leave it here.

00:16:49.775 --> 00:16:53.177
What are you thinking?
| can't take that to school!

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.047
What's his deal?

00:17:29.114 --> 00:17:29.979
Chiharu...

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:45.753
Ready...

00:18:15.961 --> 00:18:16.655
Here.

00:18:17.296 --> 00:18:19.162
| finally found the CD.

00:18:29.908 --> 00:18:32.206
What am I doing?

00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:52.962
Chiharu?

00:18:53.899 --> 00:18:54.764
Yo.

00:18:55.634 --> 00:18:57.398
What are you doing down there?

00:18:59.004 --> 00:19:03.134
| was just... Hey, what happened to the
painting? Are you still in a slump?

00:19:03.842 --> 00:19:06.971
Let's go see the cherry blossoms now.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.248
It looks like the petals
are going to fall soon.

00:19:15.387 --> 00:19:18.482
You have to take a good look
and draw them before they fall.

00:19:20.926 --> 00:19:22.394
You're not saying anything.

00:19:23.428 --> 00:19:25.226
| don't like situations like this...

00:19:30.068 --> 00:19:32.196
| think you guys are a good match.

00:19:33.639 --> 00:19:36.336
Someone from the same club
would be better for you.

00:19:38.544 --> 00:19:42.071
| run out of breath by just running a little.

00:19:42.581 --> 00:19:45.278
I'm short. I'm not good looking...

00:19:45.617 --> 00:19:46.516
How tall?

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:48.782
What?

00:19:49.154 --> 00:19:50.280
Your height.

00:19:50.556 --> 00:19:52.524
162.5cm.

00:19:52.991 --> 00:19:53.753
| see...

00:19:54.092 --> 00:19:54.854
How about you?

00:19:55.093 --> 00:19:57.027
I'm 165¢cm.

00:19:58.597 --> 00:20:01.225
You might outgrow me soon.

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:03.192
Chiharu...

00:20:03.735 --> 00:20:08.172
| told him I'd like us to stay the way we are.

00:20:08.974 --> 00:20:15.641
Sorimachi is sweet. I can count on
him and he's a wonderful person.

00:20:16.815 --> 00:20:19.546
But...

00:20:20.352 --> 00:20:22.844
That's it. I just came to tell you that.

00:20:24.189 --> 00:20:24.883
Bye.

00:20:25.924 --> 00:20:26.720
Chiharu.

00:20:27.626 --> 00:20:29.594
Come over and get your skirt.

00:20:29.962 --> 00:20:31.726
The miso soup skirt?

00:20:33.932 --> 00:20:35.866
Can I borrow a CD too?

00:20:36.168 --> 00:20:36.828
Sure.

00:20:51.216 --> 00:20:52.183
Cherry blossoms...

00:20:52.918 --> 00:20:57.219
...the regal blossoms that have witnessed
countless encounters over the ages.

00:20:57.889 --> 00:20:58.651
Cherry blossoms...

00:20:59.558 --> 00:21:02.926
...the short-lived flowers that
have seen many goodbyes...

00:21:03.962 --> 00:21:10.299
The blossoms will watch over the many
heartfelt emotions this year as well...

00:21:10.736 --> 00:21:12.431
...and open their buds once again.

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:16.139
In spring, the season of new beginnings...

00:21:17.809 --> 00:21:20.722
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:20.746 --> 00:21:26.480
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:27.085 --> 00:21:35.085
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:43.435 --> 00:21:48.396
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:21:48.707 --> 00:21:51.574
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:21:52.711 --> 00:22:00.584
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no uewo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:22:02.054 --> 00:22:06.734
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:22:06.758 --> 00:22:09.693
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:10.228 --> 00:22:15.443
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:15.467 --> 00:22:20.132
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:23.041 --> 00:22:25.887
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:25.911 --> 00:22:31.873
we just sing our favorite songs
sukina uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:32.284 --> 00:22:40.284
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

00:23:00.145 --> 00:23:02.590
Next Episode

00:23:02.614 --> 00:23:02.724
