Scent, a fracture, and an angelic nurse.

00:23:02.748 --> 00:23:05.149
Scent, a fracture, and an angelic nurse.

00:23:05.384 --> 00:23:07.853
With an unbelievable encounter,
my elated heart is going non-stop.

00:23:08.019 --> 00:23:09.987
You're not a man if you don't go for it!

